The STL files in this directory are unmodified copies of
src/model/mjcf/assets/ from the Microban repository
(https://github.com/Rhoban/microban, commit d0a128d180ecfce69eaaf31b295a0fce31280bfd).
They are exported from the Microban CAD, whose hardware design files are
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

    SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0

Because these are binary files that cannot carry an embedded notice, this
file serves as the license notice for the whole directory.

You are free to share and adapt these files for non-commercial purposes,
provided you give appropriate credit and distribute your contributions
under the same license. Commercial use requires prior written permission
from the author of Microban.

